Date: Thu, 12 Feb 2026 17:24:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] quirks: sensor: squash toshiba tablets

actually all of them have the same accel mount matrix.

(cherry picked from commit 3ca5d96411e061a8a0c2b9d86466c4f577f67f75)

Related: RHEL-72703
---
 hwdb.d/60-sensor.hwdb | 8 +-------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hwdb.d/60-sensor.hwdb b/hwdb.d/60-sensor.hwdb
index d7c9adef38..1bf1b6a66b 100644
--- a/hwdb.d/60-sensor.hwdb
+++ b/hwdb.d/60-sensor.hwdb
@@ -1182,15 +1182,9 @@ sensor:modalias:acpi:BMA250E*:dmi:bvnAmericanMegatrendsInc.:bvr5.6.5:bd04/15/201
 # Toshiba
 #########################################
 
-# Toshiba Encore WT8-B tablet
+# Toshiba Encore WT8-B | WT10A | WT10A-102 tablets
 sensor:modalias:acpi:INVN6500*:dmi:*:svnTOSHIBA:pnTOSHIBAENCORE2WT8-B:*
- ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX=0, -1, 0; -1, 0, 0; 0, 0, 1
-
-# Toshiba Encore WT10A tablet
 sensor:modalias:acpi:INVN6500*:dmi:*:svnTOSHIBA:pnTOSHIBAWT10-A-103:*
- ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX=0, -1, 0; -1, 0, 0; 0, 0, 1
-
-# Toshiba Encore WT10A-102 tablet
 sensor:modalias:acpi:INVN6500*:dmi:*:svnTOSHIBA:pnTOSHIBAWT10-A-102:*
  ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX=0, -1, 0; -1, 0, 0; 0, 0, 1
 
